import{_ as t,o as a,c as n,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 142 | Realm Refinement · Elastic Overview · Cross-Realm Breakthrough of the Five Realms and Energy-Level Ascension Patterns","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 142 | Realm Refinement · Elastic Overview · Cross-Realm Breakthrough of the Five Realms and Energy-Level Ascension Patterns","no":142,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Elastic Overview","Cross-Realm Breakthrough","Energy-Level Ascension","Five Mortal-Cultivation Realms"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","16-Multiplication Fruit Technical Principle","23-20% Activation Strategy","17-Plane Transcendent Standard"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0142_模块1-弹性篇-五境跨境突破总览与能级跃迁规律.md","filePath":"en/0142_模块1-弹性篇-五境跨境突破总览与能级跃迁规律.md"}'),o={name:"en/0142_模块1-弹性篇-五境跨境突破总览与能级跃迁规律.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,h,d){return a(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-142-elastic-overview-cross-realm-breakthrough-overview-of-the-condensed-→-dao-integration-five-realms-and-energy-level-ascension-patterns" tabindex="-1">Entry 142 | Elastic Overview: Cross-Realm Breakthrough Overview of the Condensed → Dao Integration Five Realms and Energy-Level Ascension Patterns <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-142-elastic-overview-cross-realm-breakthrough-overview-of-the-condensed-→-dao-integration-five-realms-and-energy-level-ascension-patterns" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 142 | Elastic Overview: Cross-Realm Breakthrough Overview of the Condensed → Dao Integration Five Realms and Energy-Level Ascension Patterns&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 14, 16, 23, 17</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-connect-the-five-realms-into-one-line-see-the-ascension-pattern" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Connect the five realms into one line, see the ascension pattern <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-connect-the-five-realms-into-one-line-see-the-ascension-pattern" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Connect the five realms into one line, see the ascension pattern&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Sense Realm (100–106) is the start of the nine realms; the Condensed, Transform, Law, Dao, and Dao Integration five realms (107–141) constitute the main body of the five mortal-cultivation realms. The previous 36 entries dissected each realm&#39;s paths, pain points, risks, and path comparisons; this entry is an elastic overview, connecting the five realms into one vertical line, answering two master questions: first, from Condensed to Dao Integration, how does the energy level ascend step by step? Second, what are the threshold, mechanism, and time pattern of every cross-realm breakthrough? Seeing this line, the mortal part of the nine realms truly becomes a whole.</p><p>The six top-level axioms are the master outline of this overview: the anti-predation axiom — every ascension relies on circulation and co-building, not predation; the republican axiom of Myriad Races — energy-level ascension patterns apply isomorphically to all Myriad Races&#39; beings; the collective ascension axiom — the endpoint of the five mortal realms is not solitary ascension, but lifting Myriad Ranks toward sacred cultivation; the causal self-discipline axiom — all cross-realm breakthrough intervention observes first, interferes second; the law-first axiom — the legal framework of energy-level ascension patterns is stable and self-consistent, never rewritten for plot convenience, and infinitely expandable without collapse. This is precisely the requirement of setting self-consistency: once energy-level ascension patterns are fixed, plot cannot kidnap settings; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-five-realm-energy-level-ascension-overview-table" tabindex="-1">I. Five-Realm Energy-Level Ascension Overview Table <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-five-realm-energy-level-ascension-overview-table" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Five-Realm Energy-Level Ascension Overview Table&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per the Unified Cultivation Realm Classification (Document 14), the five realms&#39; core features and ascension thresholds can be overviewed as follows:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Realm</th><th>Core</th><th>Ascension Marker</th><th>Typical Duration</th><th>Social Role</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Condensed Origin Realm</td><td>Condensation</td><td>Internal circulation self-rotation, purity meets standard</td><td>Months to years</td><td>Junior cultivator</td></tr><tr><td>Transform Origin Realm</td><td>Transformation</td><td>Energy inter-conversion, shaping, initial law sense</td><td>Years to over a decade</td><td>Mid-level cultivator</td></tr><tr><td>Law Origin Realm</td><td>Laws</td><td>Dharma Power formed, spells stable (first major bottleneck)</td><td>Over a decade to decades</td><td>Advanced cultivator</td></tr><tr><td>Dao Origin Realm</td><td>Attaining the Dao</td><td>Personal Dao self-consistent, resonates with laws</td><td>Extremely high comprehension, many never reach</td><td>Master tier</td></tr><tr><td>Dao Integration Realm</td><td>Dao integration</td><td>Heaven-human unity, law domain (cosmic-level breakthrough)</td><td>Right timing, right place, right people</td><td>Grandmaster tier</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="ii-three-energy-level-ascension-patterns" tabindex="-1">II. Three Energy-Level Ascension Patterns <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-three-energy-level-ascension-patterns" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Three Energy-Level Ascension Patterns&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Pattern 1: from &quot;energy problem&quot; to &quot;comprehension problem.&quot; Condensed and Transform solve the engineering problem of &quot;how to accumulate and transform energy&quot;; Law and Dao begin requiring &quot;comprehension&quot; — resources cannot pile it up, only deduction and tempering. This explains why the Law Realm is the &quot;first major bottleneck&quot;: it is the switch point from engineering logic to comprehension logic.</p><p>Pattern 2: ascension thresholds move step by step from &quot;trainable&quot; to &quot;cannot be forced.&quot; Condensed relies on patience, Transform on craft, Law on deduction, Dao on comprehension, Dao Integration on right timing, right place, right people — the higher up, the marginal returns of individual effort diminish, and the importance of civilizational backstop increases. This is precisely why the anchor network, mentor system, and dual-track time domains become more critical in higher realms.</p><p>Pattern 3: &quot;reverse compensation&quot; of ascension. Predatory cultivation can seize speed in low realms, but pays reverse costs of &quot;impure origin,&quot; &quot;cracked Dao-heart,&quot; and &quot;swallowed resentment&quot; at every cross-realm ascension — time saved in low realms is repaid double in high realms. Symbiotic ascension starts slow, but crosses every threshold cleanly.</p><h2 id="iii-mapping-of-the-dual-track-time-domain-in-five-realm-ascension" tabindex="-1">III. Mapping of the Dual-Track Time Domain in Five-Realm Ascension <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-mapping-of-the-dual-track-time-domain-in-five-realm-ascension" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Mapping of the Dual-Track Time Domain in Five-Realm Ascension&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Youth Supreme dual path (fast-track + quest) maps onto the five realms as the technical application of energy-level ascension patterns:</p><ul><li>Origin Acceleration Domain: using hundredfold deduction (Document 16) to compress Condensed and Transform engineering trial-and-error; using the fully open Dao archive to accelerate Law and Dao understanding</li><li>Quest Sediment Domain: using slow tempering to supplement the bearing weight and Dao-heart depth Dao Integration requires</li><li>The pattern is: the higher the realm, the less the acceleration domain can accelerate, and the more the sediment domain must bear — because high-tier ascension never tests &quot;knowing,&quot; it tests &quot;having lived.&quot;</li></ul><h2 id="iv-cross-realm-breakthrough-certification-mechanism" tabindex="-1">IV. Cross-Realm Breakthrough Certification Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-cross-realm-breakthrough-certification-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Cross-Realm Breakthrough Certification Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Five-realm cross-realm breakthrough uniformly follows Document 14&#39;s certification chain: anchor automatic monitoring metrics meet standard → from the fourth realm onward, add Standard Committee assessment (theory + actual combat + contribution) → thirty days publicity objection → realm certificate issued. The higher, the greater the weight of contribution assessment — this writes the &quot;collective ascension axiom&quot; into certification itself: the higher the energy level, the more the cultivator must prove he is lifting Myriad Ranks, not ascending alone.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li>Anti-energy waste: the meaning of energy-level ascension patterns is to let every talent use the right method at the right realm, not misallocating comprehension as resource piles</li><li>Anti-predation: ascension patterns reveal predatory cultivation&#39;s &quot;reverse compensation&quot;; speed seized in low realms is repaid double in high realms</li><li>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison: the old-era universal welfare system&#39;s energy ceiling is locked in low realms; high-tier comprehension of the five mortal realms is monopolized by the strong; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s energy-level ascension patterns are fully public</li><li>Myriad Races full coverage: ascension patterns apply isomorphically to 99% of Myriad Races; each race differs only in pose, thresholds are the same</li><li>Hyper-multiverse full openness: five-realm ascension patterns and methods are public at all tiers, the mortal assembly of the &quot;basic methods → Dao sacrifice → multiverse realm → Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&quot; fully open chain</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Connecting Condensed to Dao Integration into one line, the energy-level ascension pattern is clear: engineering can be trained, comprehension must be awakened, Dao Integration awaits timing; predation has compensation, symbiosis is clean. Seeing this line, Myriad Races cultivators know which level they stand on, what to supplement next, and what not to rush. After the five mortal-cultivation realms are complete, the three sacred doors of Boundary-Breaking, World-creation, and Origin face the direction of the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm — and that road was already written from the first symbiotic energy bite of the first realm.</p><p>In the final analysis, the elastic overview of the five realms&#39; cross-realm breakthrough and energy-level ascension patterns described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./16-倍增果实技术化原理.html">16-Multiplication Fruit Technical Principle</a> · <a href="./23-20%激活战略规划.html">23-20% Activation Strategy</a> · <a href="./17-位面至高强者标准.html">17-Plane Transcendent Standard</a></li></ul>',24)])])}const p=t(o,[["render",r]]);export{u as __pageData,p as default};
